# jwt/

Contains ECDSA P-256 key pairs for JWT signing and verification using the ES256 algorithm, plus tooling for key generation. Includes both production keys and bad keys for testing invalid signature scenarios.

## Files

- `signing_private_key.pem` -- Primary ECDSA private key (P-256) for signing JWT tokens
- `signing_public_key.pem` -- Primary ECDSA public key (P-256) for verifying JWT tokens
- `regenerate_jwt_signing_key_pair.sh` -- Script to generate or regenerate key pairs (creates both good and bad keys)
- `bad_signing_private_key.pem` -- Secondary ECDSA private key for testing invalid signature detection
- `bad_signing_public_key.pem` -- Secondary ECDSA public key for testing verification failures
